cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to AMEP, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AMEP: Agentic Mandate Evidence Protocol"
abstract: >-
  An open protocol for proving that actions taken by AI agents stayed within
  the authority a person delegated. It defines signed evidence objects for
  each link from mandate to independently observed effect, a deterministic
  three-valued evaluation (preserved, violated, unresolved), and a
  conformance suite.
